---
import MarketingLayout from "../layouts/MarketingLayout.astro";
import { urls } from "../lib/urls";
---
<MarketingLayout
  title="Hardware Compatibility"
  description="Device categories Vyfoo is built to run on: tablets, Android POS terminals, Windows touchscreens, browser-based displays, and thermal printers."
  path="/hardware-compatibility"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Hardware Compatibility</p>
      <h1>Hardware compatibility</h1>
      <p>Vyfoo is built around common restaurant hardware categories rather than a single proprietary terminal.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container grid-auto grid-auto--2">
      <div class="card"><h3>Tablets (iPadOS)</h3><p>For counter POS, QR ordering management, and order status displays.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Android POS terminals</h3><p>For counter and staff-facing order entry.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Windows touchscreens</h3><p>For counter POS on existing Windows hardware.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Browser-enabled smart TVs / displays</h3><p>For kitchen display and customer order-status screens.</p></div>
      <div class="card"><h3>Thermal printers</h3><p>For kitchen tickets and customer receipts.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="caveat-note">
      We present compatibility at the device-category level. We don't claim validated compatibility with every
      manufacturer or specific model — confirm your exact hardware with our team before purchasing new equipment
      for a rollout.
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="section section--ink">
    <div class="container cta-split">
      <div><h2>Validate your existing hardware</h2></div>
      <a class="btn btn--on-ink btn--lg" href={urls.bookDemo}>Book Enterprise Demo</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</MarketingLayout>
<style>.cta-split { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-6); } .cta-split h2 { margin: 0; }</style>
